{
  "readme": [
    "Where each vendor's Ubuntu kernel source lives, per Ubuntu series. Read by scripts/c3_lookup.py and scripts/instantiate.py.",
    "A (vendor, series) pair that is not listed here is never offered. To support a new series or vendor, add a row, then run: python3 scripts/c3_lookup.py vendors",
    "Every row is checked live against Launchpad on each run, so a wrong or stale row shows up as no-repo / no-tags instead of being trusted.",
    "",
    "Vendor fields:",
    "  display          name shown to the user",
    "  c3_make          substring of the manufacturer name in the C3 certification database (make__icontains)",
    "  c3_model_regex   optional; keep only C3 models matching this regex (e.g. drop DGX servers from NVIDIA)",
    "",
    "Series row fields (series: focal | jammy | noble | resolute):",
    "  repo             Launchpad git path, e.g. ~owner/ubuntu/+source/<package>/+git/<series>",
    "  tag_prefix       release tags are <tag_prefix><version>; the character after the prefix must be a digit",
    "  flavour          kernel flavour; equals the suffix of the kernel version, e.g. 5.15.0-1041-mtk -> mtk",
    "  release_source   tag (default) or commit. Use commit only when the repository publishes no release tags",
    "  branch           required when release_source is commit: the branch whose tip is pinned",
    "  exclude_tag_regex  optional; tags matching this are ignored when picking the latest release",
    "  toolchain        optional: none | clang18 | clang21. Overrides the series default (focal/jammy none, noble clang18, resolute clang21)",
    "  build_validated  {deb, snap}: true only if that kernel build was actually run in a workshop for this row.",
    "                   The two targets are validated separately: a .deb build says nothing about the Ubuntu Core snap build.",
    "",
    "Out of scope for now: NXP i.MX, and the generic x86 kernel (not an EVK)."
  ],
  "vendors": {
    "mediatek": {
      "display": "MediaTek",
      "c3_make": "Mediatek",
      "series": {
        "jammy": {
          "repo": "~canonical-kernel/ubuntu/+source/linux-mtk/+git/jammy",
          "tag_prefix": "Ubuntu-mtk-",
          "flavour": "mtk",
          "build_validated": {"deb": true, "snap": false}
        },
        "noble": {
          "repo": "~canonical-kernel/ubuntu/+source/linux-mtk/+git/noble",
          "tag_prefix": "Ubuntu-mtk-",
          "flavour": "mtk",
          "build_validated": {"deb": true, "snap": false}
        }
      }
    },
    "qualcomm": {
